OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1935, tens of thousands who had
OL,14,     Ffollowed Mao Zedong on the Long
OL,15,     FMarch across China struggled to
OL,16,     Fsurvive. They were fleeing Chiang
OL,17,     FKai-shek's Nationalist forces.
